WEBVTT

00:00:07,950 --> 00:00:15,390
Next question. My right light bulb has malfunction. The cord leading to the bulb has a cut in it,

00:00:15,390 --> 00:00:22,030
so it sparks and causes the bulb to make sizzling noises. Well, that's not good because we're

00:00:22,030 --> 00:00:27,630
trying to create frequencies to help heal your cancer and we're not cooking bacon. So sizzling

00:00:27,630 --> 00:00:34,910
noises are not a good thing to be hearing from your bulb or from the cords. Question is can this

00:00:34,910 --> 00:00:42,430
be fixed or can I purchase a new one? How would I purchase that? What should I do? So that's another

00:00:42,430 --> 00:00:47,870
issue. It doesn't repair those things. They would just say you just need to buy a new one.

00:00:49,470 --> 00:00:56,750
I can't repair those things. So you know, I just don't have the skills to take your bulb apart without

00:00:56,750 --> 00:01:04,270
losing the gas because your bulb is a gas-filled tube and you have to have the machinery to be able to

00:01:04,270 --> 00:01:10,830
resolder that on correctly and for it to work correctly to put a new wire on there. So really,

00:01:10,830 --> 00:01:15,870
you just need to get a new one. You can order it directly from TrueRife or you can order from

00:01:15,870 --> 00:01:21,790
our website. If you order directly from TrueRife, you're going to get their little new model. It is

00:01:21,790 --> 00:01:29,710
a little more expensive. I still have some of the older model bulbs on our website. I just had

00:01:29,790 --> 00:01:36,670
a collection of them. So you know, you could get it from there. Usually, so how does this happen?

00:01:36,670 --> 00:01:47,630
How do you get a cut in the in the cord? In 99% of the time, it's because you got caught underneath

00:01:47,630 --> 00:01:55,710
a rocking chair or something like that or that's your, just like you could get a cut in any extension

00:01:55,710 --> 00:02:04,510
cord, it got snagged on something. So the worst, the biggest thing for the bulbs is a rocking chair.

00:02:04,510 --> 00:02:14,270
So I damaged my cord the same way and had to get a new bulb of a while ago. So you could just go

00:02:14,270 --> 00:02:22,110
on our store in order from our store. It's less expensive because it's the older model, but it's

00:02:22,110 --> 00:02:32,110
still a new bulb.

